<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 29.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    101/102     UNQ     185/189</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/97    102/103   189/192   200/203</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker levels hovered around their recent low levels on Thursday and the weakening cargo market further dampened sentiment, traders said. Demand from shipowners was poor while suppliers said they could not afford lowering offers as they would make a loss.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
